    <DataNode elementId="MONOMER-11913" textLabel="MONOMER-11913" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="MONOMER-11913" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="215" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">This enzymatic activity was detected in protein extracts of &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; leaves |CITS:[16306049]|. The reaction was stimulated by addition of all four nucleotides (ATP, CTP, GTP and UTP) with the same efficiency (although GTP was slightly more effective). As the enzymatic activity appears to be associated with insoluble fractions, and therefore membranes, which corroborates the finding that this activity was detected in chloroplast envelope membranes |CITS:[16306049]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-11913" />
